    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the <strong>Wild West</strong> with <strong>Wanted: Dead or Alive</strong>, a fast-paced puzzle game that will put your observation skills to the test. Your mission: <strong>spot the wanted outlaw among a crowd of ever-moving cowboys</strong>. As you progress, the challenge intensifies\u2014time speeds up, and a single mistake could cost you your bounty. With its simple yet addictive gameplay, <strong>Wanted: Dead or Alive</strong> will push your reflexes and focus to the limit. <strong>Can you catch all the bandits before they vanish into the crowd?</strong></p>",
